"As you walk down the narrow path, giant vultures circle overhead, casting" 
"dark shadows across the sky while a heavy, foul stench fills the air. Pushing" 
"forward past jagged rocks and tall grass, you discover a decaying corpse hidden" 
"away. The shocking sight of rotted flesh and bones hits you hard, making bile" 
"rise in your throat as an instinctual wave of disgust takes over. This grim" 
"discovery warns of immediate danger ahead."
""
